    "name": "Salanova Lettuce Mix",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Salanova lettuce mix is&nbsp;a popular salad mix made from a specific type of lettuce.&nbsp;It's known for its \"one-cut, ready\" principle, where a single cut at the base of the head separates into numerous, uniformly-sized, ready-to-eat leaves.&nbsp;Salanova lettuce mixes are available in various colors and textures, including butter, crisp, and oakleaf varieties</span></p>",
